---
/** A high-level, provider-neutral default-loop guardrail lifecycle. */
---

<figure class="guardrails-architecture" aria-labelledby="guardrails-architecture-title">
  <figcaption id="guardrails-architecture-title" class="sr-only">
    Guardrails lifecycle for a default-loop Harness agent.
  </figcaption>

  <ol class="guardrails-architecture__path" aria-label="Protected default-loop path">
    <li class="guardrails-architecture__stage guardrails-architecture__stage--before">
      <span class="guardrails-architecture__timing">Before a model call</span>
      <strong>Typed input</strong>
      <span>Schema and application authentication</span>
    </li>
    <li class="guardrails-architecture__stage guardrails-architecture__stage--control">
      <span class="guardrails-architecture__timing">Automatic</span>
      <strong>Input rails</strong>
      <span>Allow, block, or transform</span>
    </li>
    <li class="guardrails-architecture__stage guardrails-architecture__stage--parallel">
      <span class="guardrails-architecture__timing">Application-owned</span>
      <strong>Retrieval</strong>
      <span>Explicit filter before context joins</span>
    </li>
    <li class="guardrails-architecture__stage guardrails-architecture__stage--model">
      <span class="guardrails-architecture__timing">Provider boundary</span>
      <strong>Model call</strong>
      <span>Provider adapter and normal model span</span>
    </li>
    <li class="guardrails-architecture__stage guardrails-architecture__stage--control">
      <span class="guardrails-architecture__timing">After each model result</span>
      <strong>Output rails</strong>
      <span>Before a tool or final delivery</span>
    </li>
    <li class="guardrails-architecture__stage guardrails-architecture__stage--tool">
      <span class="guardrails-architecture__timing">Only when requested</span>
      <strong>Tool rails</strong>
      <span>Before input and after result</span>
    </li>
    <li class="guardrails-architecture__stage guardrails-architecture__stage--after">
      <span class="guardrails-architecture__timing">After the final result</span>
      <strong>Validate and deliver</strong>
      <span>Schema, persistence, event, or response</span>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <div class="guardrails-architecture__evidence" aria-label="Evidence emitted at every guardrail boundary">
    <span>Every rail decision</span>
    <strong>Content-free GUARDRAIL span · metric · structured log</strong>
    <span>Model checks retain their nested model span for provider, model, tokens, and cost analysis when reported.</span>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .guardrails-architecture {
    border-block: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .guardrails-architecture__path {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(7, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .guardrails-architecture__stage {
    min-height: 11.5rem;
    padding: 1.15rem;
    border-inline-end: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .guardrails-architecture__stage:last-child { border-inline-end: 0; }

  .guardrails-architecture__stage { position: relative; }
  .guardrails-architecture__stage:not(:last-child)::after {
    background: var(--color-bg);
    color: var(--color-fg-muted);
    content: '→';
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1rem;
    inset-inline-end: -0.55rem;
    inset-block-start: 50%;
    line-height: 1;
    padding: 0.2rem;
    position: absolute;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .guardrails-architecture__timing {
    color: var(--color-fg-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .guardrails-architecture__stage strong { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.25; }
  .guardrails-architecture__stage > span:last-child { color: var(--color-fg-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.45; }
  .guardrails-architecture__stage--control { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-con) 9%, transparent); }
  .guardrails-architecture__stage--parallel { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-found) 7%, transparent); }
  .guardrails-architecture__stage--model { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-pilot) 8%, transparent); }
  .guardrails-architecture__stage--tool { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-con) 5%, transparent); }

  .guardrails-architecture__evidence {
    align-items: center;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    grid-template-columns: 10rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
  }

  .guardrails-architecture__evidence > span { color: var(--color-fg-muted); font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.45; }
  .guardrails-architecture__evidence > strong { color: var(--color-found-hi); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.76rem; grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; line-height: 1.5; }
  .guardrails-architecture__evidence > span:last-child { grid-column: 2; }

  @media (max-width: 1050px) {
    .guardrails-architecture__path { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .guardrails-architecture__stage:nth-child(4) { border-inline-end: 0; }
    .guardrails-architecture__stage:nth-child(4)::after { display: none; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .guardrails-architecture__path { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .guardrails-architecture__stage, .guardrails-architecture__stage:nth-child(4) { border-block-end: 1px solid var(--color-line); border-inline-end: 0; min-height: auto; }
    .guardrails-architecture__stage:not(:last-child)::after { content: '↓'; inset-block: auto -0.7rem; inset-inline: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); }
    .guardrails-architecture__stage:last-child { border-block-end: 0; }
    .guardrails-architecture__evidence { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .guardrails-architecture__evidence > strong, .guardrails-architecture__evidence > span:last-child { grid-column: auto; grid-row: auto; }
  }
</style>
